{"id":"fd9d450264433858","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-FS-n.md","title":"原书的有界规则片段 FS下标n","display":"df-FS-n — 原书的有界规则片段 FS下标n","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-FS-n","aliases":["91-df-FS-n","91-df-FS-sequence"],"display":"df-FS-n — 原书的有界规则片段 FS下标n","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-FS-n"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-FS-n</span><span>91-df-FS-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-FS-n — 原书的有界规则片段 FS下标n"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FSN}\">\\(\\mathrm{FSN}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a> 中不含真理规则的公理闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 仅使用经典一阶规则。</li>\n<li>固定无未解除假设的线性 Hilbert 证明格式；capture、release 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a> 使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FSN},R}(\\pi,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FSN},R}(\\pi,a)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是终式编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的有限 Hilbert 证明：\n公理来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FSN}\">\\(\\mathrm{FSN}\\)</span> 的生成公理，每个非公理步骤为经典规则或指定的\ncapture/release；真理规则的前式必须是闭句定理。\n此证明谓词不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\)</span> 加为额外公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{\\rm cap}(\\pi)\">\\(c_{\\rm cap}(\\pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{\\rm rel}(\\pi)\">\\(c_{\\rm rel}(\\pi)\\)</span> 分别计证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 中应用两条真理规则的次数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS\\text{-}n}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FS}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA}_T,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FS}_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{FSN}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS\\text{-}n}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FS}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA}_T,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FS}_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{FSN}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;1\">\\(n&gt;1\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\mid\\exists\\pi\\,[\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FSN},R}(\\pi,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land c_{\\rm cap}(\\pi)\\le n-1\\land c_{\\rm rel}(\\pi)\\le n-1]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FS}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\mid\\exists\\pi\\,[\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FSN},R}(\\pi,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land c_{\\rm cap}(\\pi)\\le n-1\\land c_{\\rm rel}(\\pi)\\le n-1]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})=\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\mathrm{FS}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})=\\bigcup_{n&lt;\\omega}\\mathrm{FS}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 14.12 先限制作用的不同句子数；在固定线性证明中可去掉重复应用，Lemma 14.13 将其化为上述次数界。这里每条规则分别计数，不用合计的“嵌套高度”冒充原书定义。\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_1\\)</span> 是单独规定的无真理规则但含反射的片段；\n不能把它的额外反射公理作为所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;1\">\\(n&gt;1\\)</span> 证明的免费公理。\nLemma 14.5 的反射推导使用 NEC；在有界证明中如需该结论，\n必须展开推导并计入其规则应用。原书的特殊 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}_1\\)</span> 也不等于\n把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 直接代入后面的计数式所得的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FSN}\">\\(\\mathrm{FSN}\\)</span>。\n这些片段仍穷尽 FS：每个有界证明都是 FS 证明，\n而反射由 Lemma 14.5 在 FS 中可证；反之任一有限 FS 证明都在某个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;1\">\\(n&gt;1\\)</span> 的计数界以内。\n有界片段不自动闭合于任意合并两段证明的操作，不能不加论证称其为经典演绎闭合理论。原书 Theorem 14.15 给出各片段的有限修正语义。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 14.5、Definition 14.12、Lemmata 14.13–14.14，\n印刷页 147–148、154–156，PDF 页 158–159、165–167。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FSN}$ 为 [[91-df-FS]] 中不含真理规则的公理闭包；$\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 仅使用经典一阶规则。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定无未解除假设的线性 Hilbert 证明格式；capture、release 按 [[91-df-FS]] 使用。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)$ 见 [[91-df-global-reflection]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FSN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FSN},R}(\\pi,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FSN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"c_{\\rm cap}(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"c_{\\rm rel}(\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}FS\\text{-}n}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{FS}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PA}_T,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FS}_1\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{FSN}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"n>1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\mid\\exists\\pi\\,[\\operatorname{Prf}_{\\mathrm{FSN},R}(\\pi,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land c_{\\rm cap}(\\pi)\\le n-1\\land c_{\\rm rel}(\\pi)\\le n-1]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{FS})=\\bigcup_{n<\\omega}\\mathrm{FS}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_1","display":false},{"tex":"n>1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}_1","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FSN}","display":false},{"tex":"n>1","display":false}],"bytes":2747,"backlinks":[{"id":"ccf84662da3832c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FS}_n$ 是 [[91-df-FS-n]] 的有限规则片段，$\\mathrm{FS}=\\bigcup_n\\mathrm{FS}_n$；$\\Gamma$ 是 [[91-df-revision-theory]] 的经典修正。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-FS-n]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-FS-n]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-tr